{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026ubOFXDfSLM1794213780.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>內地股市個別發展，四大指數兩升兩跌。</p><p></p><p>上證綜合指數和滬深300指數，均靠穩。   深證成分指數和深圳創業板指數則先升後回軟，收市跌幅不足百分之1。滬深京三市成交接近1.5萬億元人民幣。</p><p></p><p>煤炭和燃氣板塊造好。光伏設備股則高開低收。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.050696+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":114,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T08:42:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T11:57:00.926429+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:28.761436+00:00","content_hash":"63dcf4e70931f027a8024cdae6cdb18fade19e73a6486d6540d4f7248ce0c3e5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.050696+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}